This repository contains the experiment harness, adapters, recorded outputs, analysis, and presentation assets prepared with AI assistance.

Upstream model source and model weights are not bundled. The inference adapters call the public Dev, Kev, Von and Laya interfaces. The Kev adapter preserves the upstream MLX loading/adapter-merge approach with local artifact resolution; its source is jaredpalmer/kev at fdfdfd2c7a98225715a9cc8f4d9e1ef29ebbe79c (Apache-2.0). The upstream Apache license is retained in LICENSE.

